          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigira yaga, Nyasaye yavaleka vakole vindu vidamanu viemioyo jaavo jikayirwa, kandi vakora vindu vie zisoni nu kwononyia vukumi vwi miviri jaavo aveene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vagirung'anyia agiligali ga Nyasaye kuva vovehi; vasigamira nu kutumikira vindu via Nyasaye yalomba mu vogono vwu Mulombi mwene, udukana kwizominywa mihiga ni mihiga! Amini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigira vaakora yago, Nyasaye yavaleka mu likayirwa liavo lie zisoni. Kali avakali vaavo vagirung'anyia umwima gwaavo gwu kuva harara na vasaza, nivava harara na vakali vandi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munzira ndala nzere avasaza ndio, valeka umwima gwaavo gwu kuva harara na vakali, kandi vakayirwa kuva harara na vasaza vandi. Avasaza vakora vindu vie zisoni ku vache vaavo, mu likora ndio, veleteraa aveene amageri gaduukanaa na mahiolo gaavo gavakolaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigira avandu yavo vasuura limanya lieligali lia Nyasaye, Nyasaye yavaleka muziganagani zionekaa, ku vaduuki kokora ivindu via vataduukanaa kokora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vizuyi zing'ano ziosi zie kivihiri, uvudamanu, uvuhuvaali, likayirwa iviaveene kandi uvwoneku. Vayizula embodoka, uvwiti, zimbemba, uvukubani, lihing'ana, uvugadi, zing'anagani zindamanu na amanyego; vamonyanaa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi vahuzirizaa, avandu vu kuvihilira Nyasaye, avatindi, avelori, avukwiyizominya, avigingiri, avakongi vi vindu vidamanu, na avatahuliraa aviivuli vaavo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "si vaveeye ni limanya, avatasuuvirwa, vataveeye nuvuyanzi, avatasamiihaa kandi avataveeraa avandi zimbavasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kali niiva vamanya lilago lia Nyasaye livoora ndi, avandu vamenya munzira yiyi vaduukana likuza. Nitali sigaveeye vuzwa yavo vazizagilira kokora ivindu viene yivi, navuzwa vavugilira avandu vandi vakolaa vindu zana yivi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
